Gwyneth Paltrow is a lady of many  talents in addition to acting singing  writing books and raising children she's  also now a marvel secret spoiler in an  interview with Titan Publishing's  official Avengers infinity war magazine  Paltrow who portrays Pepper Potts in the  Marvel Cinematic Universe may have  spilled a major spoiler about Avengers 4  the actress opened up about her  character's relationship with Robert  Downey jr. 'he's Tony Stark better known  to the world as Iron Man and as it turns  out her scene in infinity war might have  been a prelude for big news to come from  stark tower in the beginning of infinity  war Tony tells Pepper that he had a  dream she was pregnant  pepper brushes the comment aside neither  confirming nor denying whether she's  actually expecting before Tony jets off  to the cosmos to do battle with danos  while Pepper might have been playing coy  Paltrow didn't hold back she seems to  tell fans in the magazine feature that  Pepper has not only survived  Thanos as Infinity Gauntlet snap but  that she's also with child saying Pepper  and Tony have had a really long journey  together  she obviously starts as his dutiful  assistant and then the relationship  evolves and now this decade later  they're married and they have a child  their relationship has evolved in all of  the ways that great romances evolved the  turn of phrase Paltrow used here still  invites some questions of course by  saying the two have a child it could  mean that she's pregnant in Avengers 4  which would mean that the film picks up  just after infinity war or it could mean  that by the time the next film comes  along she'll have already had a little  one with the billionaire philanthropist  superhero  of course the lovebirds could always end  up adopting a child since there's bound  to be plenty of orphans left in the wake  of Thanos  snap but in either case it looks like  the Starks will become a party of three  in Avengers 4 somehow considering how  protective Marvel is over their plot  details it's pretty baffling how  Paltrow's remarks here made it to Prince  but perhaps the studio just wanted to  give fans a reason to be optimistic  after so much devastation and infinity  war yeah  after all what better way to say goodbye  to the guy who started it all than to  make him turn a complete 180 from the  selfish spoiled magnet  once was into a doting dad who wants to  live a humble quiet life instead  whatever does come of this news let's  just hope we get some kind of happy end  and not the Tony and his son die  together one as seen in the comics we'll  know for sure what Paltrow's mention of  pepper secret bun in the oven entails  when Avengers four arrives on May 3rd  2019 thanks for watching click the  looper icon to subscribe to our YouTube  channel plus check out all this cool  stuff we know you love to
 

